{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1151662-can-a-sufficiently-powerful-strix-command-an-army-of-owls","id":1151662,"title":"Can a sufficiently powerful Strix command an army of Owls?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-21T09:53:25-07:00","id":1151662,"title":"Can a sufficiently powerful Strix command an army of Owls?","content":"There's a very important moment in the finale of my Paris campaign where the exiled childe of the Prince, now possessed by the Strix, begins a full frontal assault on Parisian Kindred by attacking them with an army of Owls. She has Shadow Potency 10, so I guess with her immense willpower she can force lesser Strix to work for her... But considering how they tend to be viciously independent, is that even possible?<br /> <br /> (Also tips on how to deal with a Masquerade breach of this caliber please)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T10:46:19-07:00","id":1151677,"title":"","content":"I don't know vampire very well but, if I recall, the Strix also flock to disaster. So that alone might be enough to attract more of them if they sensed disaster coming, and they're all, individually, itching for a fight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T10:47:47-07:00","id":1151678,"title":"","content":"It's your campaign, so there's no reason you couldn't. It might be a bit of a stretch, but I'm sure they could be clever/charismatic/brutal enough to garner a following.<br /> <br /> Whether or not it's a Masquerade breach really depends on where the fighting is occurring. If it's taking place mostly in Elysium and vampire Havens, I don't really see a problem. Most of the fighting on the part of the Strix is going to be with supernatural powers and close-combat with talons and the like. Nothing that would draw the attention of humans who aren't already present.<br /> <br /> If it's happening in the streets and in nightclubs, there may be problems. But CofD seems to indicate that most people don't want to know and make an effort to forget (see: What Have You Forgotten? for human chargen) so a news story about a fog machine gone haywire (they look like smokey shadows, after all) or gang violence or whatever should cover it. You'll probably spawn a few new Hunter cells, or the attention of a Compact/Conspiracy, if you want that plot hook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T11:22:15-07:00","id":1151690,"title":"","content":"Strix have free will and can chose to join the fun, also if the Strix opens a gate to that shadow place it could justify their numbers should you feel the need.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}